# Throwaway probes a review or fix round leaves in a package's test directory.
# `pnpm test` runs `test/*.test.mjs`, so these never run and nothing keeps them
# compiling; ignoring them stops the next round's debris reaching a commit.
packages/*/test/tmp-*
